{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act41side_level_act41side_05_end",
  "groupId": "act41side",
  "stageId": "act41side_05",
  "title": "溺火",
  "storyCode": "EA-5",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act41side/level_act41side_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9d41f799ec5b894e2ea248de466ad7223ff422b2056ac91056588fed4d45c637",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g12_castlecorridor_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "堡垒内的仆役已经全数被我遣退，那么这脚步声......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......殿下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，是你呀。来找我有什么事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您不问我为什么还回得来吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不问。你回来了，仅此而已，我忠心的仆臣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再说，你能为我带来一位什么样的客人，我心里自然有数。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......宵禁开始了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚刚开始。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那这也不算违背了我的命令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "失败了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "纳斯尔纱仍在此处，我也仍在此处，谈何失败？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "期限是夏末节。就算黑雾以不听人言闻名，这一点想必也还记得住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说真的，我该如何理解你的只言片语呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或者......你也觉得话语的交流，不如法术与毁灭来得直接？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "爱布拉娜话音未落，泛着冷光的枝叶就从黑雾中探出，直指她的咽喉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "与此同时，她的枪也刺进了厚重的雾气深处，紫色的火光在其中隐约可见，只等一个念头就将雾气燃尽。\n但枝叶毕竟并未刺进爱布拉娜的咽喉，紫火也并未在黑雾中间燃起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夏末节。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夏末节第二天的朝阳升起之前，我们都会得到那个结果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至于现在......我们都不过是在虚张声势罢了，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "爱布拉娜维持着刺入黑雾的姿势，但顷刻之后，她咽喉前的枝叶凭空消失，她枪尖的火焰也随之熄灭。\n黑雾随即散去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "殿下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你还在这里啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么，还有事吗？关于深池？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然这里只有你我，我最忠心的仆臣，我允许你再度提起这个词。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感谢您的宽宏，但是，不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帮助一个国家建立的鬼魂也仍然是鬼魂，鬼魂不应该被铭刻在历史上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我的确担忧那天和我一样留在原地的几位同僚......他们现在在何处？他们是否会对您不利？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无需担心。而且，这应当不是你冒着风险，一直留到现在的原因。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......在回来的路上，我看见了一片混乱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有的人越发狂躁，为了一点东西......甚至不为了什么就大打出手，而另一些人却像木偶般僵在原地......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "仿佛他们都是......当年随我们一同对抗维多利亚人的鬼魂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们也会没入黑暗吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里毕竟是纳斯尔纱，红龙的巢穴，塔拉的首府。我怕这里发生的一切都将震动整个塔拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看起来仍然不很信服。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "殿下......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "归根结底，我只有一个问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只有这个问题，我恳请您给我一个答复。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，我准许你的僭越。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（深吸气）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爱布拉娜殿下，那个未来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个您曾向深池许诺，向所有塔拉人许诺的未来，那个塔拉人能自由书写自己的梦想的未来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是假的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "校官的全身不住颤抖，连日来潜藏在心底的恐惧在一瞬间攫住了他。\n那恐惧和自己的下场无关。他不怕像同僚那样被黑雾吞没，不怕自己因为触怒红龙而死。\n他只怕从红龙口中听见那个自己从来不敢设想的答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "绝无虚假。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已经回答你了，校官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "红龙的声音飘渺、虚弱，却不容置疑。\n听着这无数次指挥自己走向胜利的声音，男人的脊背缓缓挺直。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我相信您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或者......你只是没有相信以外的选择？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我相信您，相信您如同此前无数次一样，选择令人费解，甚至看起来走不通的道路，但总能将我们带到离那个理想更近的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样的信任倒的确值得我的一声感谢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，纳斯尔纱城内的秩序并不需要你去维护。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然你能从黑林中归来，那么你此刻就应当回到黑林中去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "直到夏末节过去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或者......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“清晨我走入黑林，呼唤迷雾”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "殿下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听见那黑林外传来的歌声了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "距离你出城，也就不过一次日出日落的时间......干得不错，拉芙希妮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g10_indoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "城内居然发生了这样的事？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "苇草，你姐姐......她究竟在谋划什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "曾有人向我保证，她的谋划对塔拉有益而无害。可无论是她，还是替她作保的人，此刻我都无法相信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "守灵人，已经到这份上了，你们都不帮苇草一把吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她为了葬礼而来，我们也只为此才接纳她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无论如何，逝者的生平我已知晓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拿着这些绳结和花环，我们到外面去，葬礼就要开始了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "人们收起分歧，默默站起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g6_remains_inside"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "所有的守灵人都低声唱着歌，手头做着不同的事情。\n他们中有的人在装点逝者的遗体——但那也仅仅是往木匣上摆放绳结和花环罢了。\n有的人在木匣周围架起柴草。\n有的人则一边唱着，一边往前来参加葬礼的流民们手中分发蜡烛。\n小小的，明亮的火光在营地各处摇曳。\n拉芙希妮也分到一盏。她小心地将其捧在胸前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请讲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不认识逝者，说实话也没什么重要的事情要说......但是，在我老家的葬礼上，大家都可以随便说话的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然，这本就是塔拉人尊敬逝者的方式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即便已经结束，生命仍然值得庆祝，更不用说生者的欢欣对死者而言即是告慰。请随意交谈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还做了一些点心......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也请自由分享。稍后我们也会有饮食提供给各位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，考虑到库林先生英年早逝，又因城内变故横死，一些过度的行为还请各位克制。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有，在还火的过程中，请各位听我们的安排。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "莫兰，你们那的葬礼是这么办的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说到底就只是停灵守夜而已，并没有这么多传统的步骤，我也不知道“还火”究竟是什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "反正一会儿听人家的就是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "苇草，你以前参加过这种仪式吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（摇头）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g12_castlecorridor_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您是说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉芙希妮已经与守灵人会合，英雄真正的葬礼开始了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“清晨我走入黑林，呼唤迷雾，踏上通往战场的路途”......这首歌你会唱吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您明知故问了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有多少次，我都是唱着这首歌，带着年轻人们走向战场的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g14_galekingruins_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_247",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是谁？是谁在唱歌？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_247",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "该死，好容易从黑林里逃出来，都已经走到了旧王城的遗址，怎么还是能听见这首歌？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_247",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "难道我还没走出黑林？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_247",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不对，是......遗迹中央的熔炉，在发出声音？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_247",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_247",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多美的旋律啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_247",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有笛声，没有战鼓......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_247",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唯有身后钟声......穿过雾中的水珠......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_247",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_247",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也许我该回去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_247",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也许我想要的东西，只有现在才能看清......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_247",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且我真的有资格......从纳斯尔纱逃走吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g10_indoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "给，艾玛，这是今天的面包。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1696_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多谢你还愿意分我口吃的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以前你不也把吃的分我吗？就当是报恩吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1696_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可你一直盯着我手里的面包，到底......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）克制，克制......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）她是艾玛，她是之前曾经把面包分给你的人，你得帮她，你得——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（深呼吸）艾玛，我没事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是、只是想说，你这都病了多久了，一直起不来床，接下来的日子不好过啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1696_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1696_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“没有笛声，没有战鼓”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么唱起这首歌来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1696_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "远处......好像有人在唱......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g6_remains_inside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在还火仪式开始之前，请死者的亲友致辞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "苇草小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......只有一份悼词，是涅梅丝写好交给我，让我在葬礼上念的。这样可以吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然可以。请。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“给库林......”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......信？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“库林，也许过不了多久，我就会和你遭遇同样的下场......”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g2_citystreets_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g6_remains_inside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“......现在轮到我，替你背上这已经增殖到一个人的身躯难以承受的重担。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“别了，或者很快再见，库林。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“愿你我最终......”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“在温暖的火中重逢。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "与悼词念完几乎同时，一簇火焰被投向木匣周围的柴草，整个柴堆熊熊燃烧起来。\n人们按照守灵人的指示，在火堆旁围成一圈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请用自己的眼确认，死者已在火中得享安宁，不再徘徊人间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然后，请将烛火摆在离火堆尽可能近的地方，也可以直接将蜡烛投入火中，把火还给死者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果对死者有任何话要说，都请对着火焰大声说出口。无论生者赞美还是斥责，那都是记忆，都是逝者旅途中的慰藉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把火还给死者之后，请不要离开，共同在此为死者守灵，直到火焰熄灭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的守灵人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1691_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......开始吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "愿你获得安息，未曾谋面的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......骗子，还有英雄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "莫兰弯下腰，将蜡烛放在火边。火舌一瞬间就将蜡烛吞没，几乎燎着了她的手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "苇草，要不要离火近一点？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果在场有任何一个人没资格纪念库林，那只能是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是救不了他的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "莫兰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当他决定要真正当一名英雄的时候，他就已经不容于红龙的那座巢穴了，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无论如何，把火还给他吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让尘归尘，土归土，让死者带着我们的回忆沉睡，生者还要继续生活下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还火......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让死者带着我们的回忆沉睡......让生者......继续生活下去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g6_remains_inside"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在拉芙希妮若有所思的时间里，还过火的人们纷纷坐到离火堆更远的地方，最终手中擎着烛火的人只剩她一个。\n她沉默着上前，将手里的烛火投入了熊熊燃烧的火堆之中。\n死者已矣。\n那些踌躇满志的、忘乎所以的、如梦初醒的、声嘶力竭的时刻，此刻都在火中燃尽，化作逸散的烟雾，或是沉默的灰烬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
